      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
const WA_NUMBER = "919389205487"; // 9389205487 with India country code

// Pure veg menu (A2 Restaurant, Res ID 22889798). Beverages nahi. Sirf sabse chhota variant. Sabhi prices 9 par end.
